 will have their unique experience; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Dynamic open world game featuring realistic, simulated physics and systems-based gameplay. Day and night, fire, liquid, etc., all with a direct impact on gameplay; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A captivating narrative, set in a 17th century storybook atmosphere. The story changes according to the player`s progress and decisions.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556320/extras/BSI_Intense_Roguelike.gif?t=1734538039\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bootstrap Island is the most realistic survival adventure you can experience without putting your life in danger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Co-funded by European Union Creative Europe Media. <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556320/extras/Steam_Bootstrap_Island_BW_EU_logo.png?t=1734538039\" /> </p>","developers":["Maru VR Productions"],"fullgame":{"appid":"1942110","name":"Bootstrap Island"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556320/header.jpg?t=1734538039","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Bootstrap Island Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":[],"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Maru VR Productions"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Medo","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"28 Sep, 2023"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cBootstrap Island is the Most Realistic VR Game I've Ever Played. Bootstrap Island blew me away. I have played a lot of VR survival games but Bootstrap Island has the best VR survival mechanics I've ever seen.\u201d<br>habie147 - youtube<br><br>\u201cIf you would've told me there'd be a game like this in 2024 I'd call you crazy. PCVR has been neglected for many new releases in the VR scene and now we finally got a diamond in the rough. Welcome to BOOTSTRAP ISLAND!\u201d<br>AwakenToast - youtube<br><br>\u201cThe Next Gen VR Survival Experience that makes you want to stay...Bootstrap Island is incredibly detailed and for the first time in actually 2 years I did not want to put my headset off.\u201d<br>MERPTV - youtube<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556320/ss_9a98b19b3c7ddc4b90b3373e630e25d14903eba3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1734538039","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556320/ss_9a98b19b3c7ddc4b90b3373e630e25d14903eba3.600x338.jpg?t=1734538039"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556320/ss_5038664f64ab2fb87d5d6d7e7fd30af95d203fef.1920x1080.jpg?t=1734538039","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556320/ss_5038664f64ab2fb87d5d6d7e7fd30af95d203fef.600x338.jpg?t=1734538039"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556320/ss_5ca8090afbdfaef1e4ffe719ec6f2de5cd2cc70b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1734538039","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556320/ss_5ca8090afbdfaef1e4ffe719ec6f2de5cd2cc70b.600x338.jpg?t=1734538039"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556320/ss_226a715980a0f1adba29ce4678d5daf7d1ab8164.1920x1080.jpg?t=1734538039","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2556320/ss_226a715980a0f1adba29ce4678d5daf7d1ab8164.600x338.jpg?t=1734538039"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_